An item marker-line brace run measures from its written brace

```
-   {.x
   }
   z
.
<ul>
  <li>{.x
}
z</li>
</ul>
```

```
-   {.x
     }
     z
.
<ul>
  <li><p class="x">z</p></li>
</ul>
```

```
- [ ] {.x
   }
   z
.
<ul class="task-list">
  <li><input type="checkbox" disabled aria-label="{.x } z"> {.x
}
z</li>
</ul>
```

```
- [ ] {.x
       }
       z
.
<ul class="task-list">
  <li><input type="checkbox" disabled aria-label="z"> <p class="x">z</p></li>
</ul>
```
